note "integration-r7: read k37-k73 of the trace: on close the panel's surface goes at k38 and the pill now grows back from the card's box where the panel lay (k38 visual 15,62 222x171 against the card's 10,60 240x194 on the output, scale 2.19 x 7.12), springing down to its own 51,4 101x24 by k51 with a small undershoot (0.8 on y at k45) and at rest at k58; before, render had forgotten the gone panel's origin and started from the pill's own box of a second earlier, so the morph back did not show. The next-track-pill dissolve that follows runs k59-k73 instead of ending at k65 because close now settles later; the clock never moves"
